@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName "MS Gothic"
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam Padding 10
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
hide footbox
title コードに基づくルームのライフサイクル
state "待機ルーム" as Waiting
state "試合進行中" as Playing
state "結果と復帰準備" as Results
[*] --> Waiting : CreateRoom
Waiting --> Playing : TryStartGame: 2人以上\nTryStartCoopGame: 4人 (2対2)
Playing --> Results : DEAD の処理で勝者を決定
Results --> Waiting : 全参加者が READY_TO_EXIT\nisInGame = false、GAME_END
note bottom of Results
結果は概念上のフェーズです。
保存するのは isInGame、deadUsersByRoom、readyUsersByRoom です。
end note
note right of Results
RecordDeath: one result per matchId
RetryDeath: retry only the same match
READY_TO_EXIT: clear state under roomsMutex
end note
@enduml
